h2 NASA's CHAPEA Mission 2
text After a year living and working inside a simulated Mars habitat, the CHAPEA Mission 2 crew is preparing to conclude their 365-day mission. During their stay, they lived as if on Mars, growing crops, managing limited resources, and navigating communication delays. The crew will exit the habitat on Oct. 31.
link "Mars Exploration" https://www.nasa.gov/humans-in-space/nasas-simulated-mars-crew-marks-one-year-inside-habitat/
