  col
    metric Today "Image Of The Day"
    text Martian Dawn
    text The captivating shapes of wind-carved crags called yardangs are revealed in this zoomed-in crop of a broader panorama captured by NASA’s Curiosity Mars rover. Scientists are eager to learn more about how the yardang layer formed.
    link "Browse Image Archive" https://www.nasa.gov/image-of-the-day/
  col
    link "View full image page" https://www.nasa.gov/image-detail/1-pia26728-fig-a-curiosity-captures-dawn-breaking-on-wind-carved-cliffs-2/
